### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

###

### 1. Get All Tasks (GET /tasks)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks

###

### 2. Get Task by ID (Valid integer ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/1

###

### 3. Get Task by ID (Route-specific middleware: Invalid ID format -> 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/abc

###

### 4. Get Task by ID (Non-existent task -> 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/999

###

### 5. Create Task (POST /tasks with valid JSON)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Master Express.js",
  "description": "Implement middleware pipeline and RESTful CRUD endpoints"
}

###

### 6. Create Task missing Content-Type (Supplementary Problem 1 -> 415 Unsupported Media Type)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks

{
  "title": "Missing Content-Type Header"
}

###

### 7. Create Task with Missing Title (Validation error -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "No title provided"
}

###

### 8. Update Task (PUT /tasks/1)
PUT http://localhost:5000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express.js (Completed)",
  "completed": true
}

###

### 9. Update Task with Invalid ID format (Route-specific middleware -> 400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:5000/tasks/invalid-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

###

### 10. Update Non-Existent Task (404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:5000/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Non-existent task"
}

###

### 11. Delete Task (DELETE /tasks/3)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/tasks/3

###

### 12. Delete Task with Invalid ID format (400 Bad Request)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/tasks/xyz

###

### 13. Delete Non-Existent Task (404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/tasks/999

###

### 14. Undefined Route Handler (Supplementary Problem 3 -> 404 JSON)
GET http://localhost:5000/non-existent-endpoint

###

### 15. Global Error Handler Test (Deliberate 500 error)
GET http://localhost:5000/error-test
